    "body": "# Bug report\n\n### Bug description:\n\n```python\nimport fcntl\nimport termios\n\nwith open('/dev/tty', 'rb') as fd:\n    fcntl.ioctl(fd, termios.TIOCGPGRP, b'', True)\n```\n\n```\nfcntl.ioctl(fd, termios.TIOCGPGRP, b'', True)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nSystemError: buffer overflow\n```\n\n\n### CPython versions tested on:\n\nCPython main branch\n\n### Operating systems tested on:\n\nLinux\n\n<!-- gh-linked-prs -->\n### Linked PRs\n* gh-144273\n<!-- /gh-linked-prs -->\n",
